## reads the same keys), re-meant for the night: a node is a person and what they want;
## the inbox is her desk; the review is the confrontation; the standup is the security
## round. en + zh-Hans ship together (PLAN.md locale rule). Never hardcode a user-visible
## string in a scene.
##
## The fiction keeps the DLsite golden tags where they fit (ops/adult_forks/beat_monday_map.md
