## normal (常識改変), colleagues with history (同居/幼なじみ), her offer (色仕掛け), the
## building after hours (退廃/背徳), the state she comes back in (トランス/暗示). Everyone is
## an adult and everything is consensual in the fiction — she comes back on her own.
